  {
    "id": "zh_A1_func_02",
    "type": "concept",
    "category": "Funciones comunicativas",
    "title": "提供个人信息（年龄、国籍、职业）",
    "bridge": "在西班牙语中，表达年龄时我们说‘Tengo 25 años’（使用动词‘tener’），但在英语中则说‘I am 25 years old’（使用动词‘to be’）。表达国籍时我们说‘Soy español’（无冠词），但在英语中则说‘I am Spanish’（无冠词）。表达职业时我们说‘Soy profesor’（无冠词），但在英语中需要加冠词：‘I am a teacher’。",
    "rule": "表达年龄：‘I am [数字] years old’（例如：I am 25 years old）。表达国籍：‘I am [国籍]’（例如：I am Spanish, I am Mexican）。表达职业：‘I am a/an [职业]’（例如：I am a doctor, I am an engineer）。提问时：‘How old are you?’（多少岁？）、“Where are you from?”（你来自哪里？）、“What do you do?”（你做什么工作？) 或‘What is your job?’（你的职业是什么？）。",
    "concept_examples": [
      {
        "text": "I am 25 years old.",
        "translation": "我25岁。",
        "phonetic": "/aɪ æm ˈtwenti faɪv jɪəz əʊld/"
      },
      {
        "text": "I am Spanish.",
        "translation": "我是西班牙人。",
        "phonetic": "/aɪ æm ˈspænɪʃ/"
      },
      {
        "text": "I am a teacher.",
        "translation": "我是一名教师。",
        "phonetic": "/aɪ æm ə ˈtiːtʃə/"
      },
      {
        "text": "How old are you?",
        "translation": "你多少岁了？",
        "phonetic": "/haʊ əʊld ɑːr juː/"
      }
    ],
    "common_error": {
      "wrong": "I have 25 years.",
      "correct": "I am 25 years old.",
      "correct_alt": "",
      "explanation": "在西班牙语中，表达年龄时使用动词‘tener’（如‘Tengo 25 años’），但在英语中则使用动词‘to be’。这是西班牙语母语者最常见的错误之一。"
    },
    "levels": [
      {
        "level": 1,
        "label": "Age",
        "translation": "年龄",
        "examples": [
          {
            "original": "I am 30 years old.",
            "phonetic": "/aɪ æm ˈθɜːti jɪəz əʊld/",
            "translation": "我30岁。",
            "note": "表达年龄时使用‘to be’。"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "level": 2,
        "label": "Nationality",
        "translation": "国籍",
        "examples": [
          {
            "original": "I am Mexican.",
            "phonetic": "/aɪ æm ˈmeksɪkən/",
            "translation": "我是墨西哥人。",
            "note": "表达国籍时无需冠词。"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "level": 3,
        "label": "Profession",
        "translation": "职业",
        "examples": [
          {
            "original": "She is a nurse.",
            "phonetic": "/ʃiː ɪz ə nɜːs/",
            "translation": "她是一名护士。",
            "note": "表达职业时需加冠词‘a’或‘an’。"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "level": 4,
        "label": "Questions",
        "translation": "疑问句",
        "examples": [
          {
            "original": "Where are you from?",
            "phonetic": "/weə ɑːr juː frɒm/",
            "translation": "你来自哪里？",
            "note": "询问起源的疑问句。"
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "conversation": {
      "vocabulary": [],
      "dialogue": []
    },
    "translations": {
      "zh": "提供个人信息（年龄、国籍、职业）"
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "zh_A1_func_03",
    "type": "concept",
    "category": "Funciones comunicativas",
    "title": "描述物体和人物（基础）",
    "bridge": "在西班牙语中，我们用形容词+名词的顺序描述物体和人物，例如：‘un coche rojo’（一辆红色的车），‘una chica alta’（一个高个子女孩）。而在英语中，形容词放在名词前面：‘a red car’（一辆红色的车），‘a tall girl’（一个高个子女孩）。此外，我们用动词‘to be’进行一般性描述（She is tall，她很高），用‘have got’表达身体特征（She has got blue eyes，她长着蓝色眼睛）。",
    "rule": "描述时的结构：1) 形容词 + 名词（a big house，一栋大房子）。2) 主语 + 动词‘to be’ + 形容词（The house is big，这栋房子很大）。3) 主语 + ‘have/has got’ + 特征（She has got long hair，她长着长头发）。常用形容词：big（大的）、small（小的）、tall（高的）、short（矮的）、beautiful（美丽的）、old（老的）、young（年轻的）、fast（快的）、slow（慢的）。",
    "concept_examples": [
      {
        "text": "This is a big house.",
        "translation": "这是一栋大房子。",
        "phonetic": "/ðɪs ɪz ə bɪɡ haʊs/"
      },
      {
        "text": "She is tall and thin.",
        "translation": "她又高又瘦。",
        "phonetic": "/ʃiː ɪz tɔːl ænd θɪn/"
      },
      {
        "text": "He has got blue eyes.",
        "translation": "他长着蓝色眼睛。",
        "phonetic": "/hiː hæz ɡɒt bluː aɪz/"
      },
      {
        "text": "The car is red.",
        "translation": "这辆车是红色的。",
        "phonetic": "/ðə kɑːr ɪz red/"
      }
    ],
    "common_error": {
      "wrong": "a car red",
      "correct": "a red car",
      "correct_alt": "",
      "explanation": "在西班牙语中，形容词放在名词后面（如‘un coche rojo’），但在英语中形容词要放在名词前面（如‘a red car’）。这是西班牙语母语者最常犯的错误之一。"
    },
    "levels": [
      {
        "level": 1,
        "label": "Adjective + noun",
        "translation": "形容词 + 名词",
        "examples": [
          {
            "original": "a small dog",
            "phonetic": "/ə smɔːl dɒɡ/",
            "translation": "一只小狗",
            "note": "形容词放在名词前面。"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "level": 2,
        "label": "Subject + to be + adjective",
        "translation": "主语 + to be + 形容词",
        "examples": [
          {
            "original": "The book is interesting.",
            "phonetic": "/ðə bʊk ɪz ˈɪntrəstɪŋ/",
            "translation": "这本书很有趣。",
            "note": "用‘to be’进行一般性描述。"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "level": 3,
        "label": "have/has got for features",
        "translation": "用have/has got表达特征",
        "examples": [
          {
            "original": "She has got curly hair.",
            "phonetic": "/ʃiː hæz ɡɒt ˈkɜːli heə/",
            "translation": "她长着卷发。",
            "note": "用‘have got’表达身体特征。"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "level": 4,
        "label": "Combined description",
        "translation": "综合描述",
        "examples": [
          {
            "original": "My brother is young and he has got green eyes.",
            "phonetic": "/maɪ ˈbrʌðə ɪz jʌŋ ænd hiː hæz ɡɒt ɡriːn aɪz/",
            "translation": "我弟弟很年轻，长着绿色眼睛。",
            "note": "结合使用‘to be’和‘have got’。"
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "conversation": {
      "vocabulary": [],
      "dialogue": []
    },
    "translations": {
      "zh": "中文"
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "zh_A1_func_04",
    "type": "concept",
    "category": "Funciones comunicativas",
    "title": "Talk about daily routines / 讨论日常作息",
    "bridge": "在西班牙语中，我们用一般现在时来谈论日常作息，例如：‘Me levanto a las 7, desayuno y voy al trabajo’。在英语中，我们也用一般现在时来表达同样的意思：‘I get up at 7, have breakfast and go to work’。主要的区别在于英语中使用介词‘at’表示具体时间（如‘at 7 o'clock’）、“in”表示一天中的某个时段（如‘in the morning’）、“on”表示具体日期（如‘on Monday’）。此外，我们还会在动词前使用频率副词，如‘always’、‘usually’、‘sometimes’。",
    "rule": "要表达日常作息：1) 使用一般现在时（如：I get up, she works）。2) 使用时间表达式：‘at’ + 具体时间（如at 8 am）、“in” + 时段（如in the morning）、“on” + 具体日期（如on Friday）。3) 在动词前使用频率副词（如I always eat breakfast）。4) 提问时用：‘What time do you get up？’或‘When do you have lunch？’",
    "concept_examples": [
      {
        "text": "I get up at 7 o'clock.",
        "translation": "我七点钟起床。",
        "phonetic": "/aɪ ɡet ʌp æt ˈsevən əˈklɒk/"
      },
      {
        "text": "She usually has breakfast at 8 am.",
        "translation": "她通常早上八点吃早餐。",
        "phonetic": "/ʃiː ˈjuːʒuəli hæz ˈbrekfəst æt eɪt æm/"
      },
      {
        "text": "We go to work at 9 in the morning.",
        "translation": "我们上午九点去上班。",
        "phonetic": "/wiː ɡəʊ tə wɜːk æt naɪn ɪn ðə ˈmɔːnɪŋ/"
      },
      {
        "text": "What time do you have dinner?",
        "translation": "你几点吃晚饭？",
        "phonetic": "/wɒt taɪm duː juː hæv ˈdɪnə/"
      }
    ],
    "common_error": {
      "wrong": "I am eating breakfast every morning.",
      "correct": "I eat breakfast every morning.",
      "correct_alt": "",
      "explanation": "在西班牙语中，我们有时会用现在进行时来表示习惯性动作（如‘estoy desayunando cada mañana’），但在英语中，表达日常习惯和重复性动作时，必须使用一般现在时而非进行时。"
    },
    "levels": [
      {
        "level": 1,
        "label": "Daily actions",
        "translation": "日常活动",
        "examples": [
          {
            "original": "I get up early.",
            "phonetic": "/aɪ ɡet ʌp ˈɜːli/",
            "translation": "我起得很早。",
            "note": "使用一般现在时表示习惯。"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "level": 2,
        "label": "Time expressions",
        "translation": "时间表达",
        "examples": [
          {
            "original": "I have lunch at 1 pm.",
            "phonetic": "/aɪ hæv lʌntʃ æt wʌn piː em/",
            "translation": "我下午一点吃午饭。",
            "note": "具体时间用'at'。"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "level": 3,
        "label": "Frequency adverbs",
        "translation": "频率副词",
        "examples": [
          {
            "original": "She never drinks coffee.",
            "phonetic": "/ʃiː ˈnevə drɪŋks ˈkɒfi/",
            "translation": "她从不喝咖啡。",
            "note": "副词置于主要动词前。"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "level": 4,
        "label": "Questions about routines",
        "translation": "提问日常作息",
        "examples": [
          {
            "original": "What time do you go to bed?",
            "phonetic": "/wɒt taɪm duː juː ɡəʊ tə bed/",
            "translation": "你几点睡觉？",
            "note": "用‘what time’ + do/does提问。"
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "conversation": {
